#Протокол_Intent_Hierarchy_Pilot<[
Базис:
  Intent tree migration split work/backlog.bvc в intent/**/*.work.bvc, но rebuild нужен явный слой domain/feature/plan labels для routing, UI sidebar и Step canon migration.
  Labels intent.domain и intent.feature — rebuildable projection; canonical identity остаётся work.id.
Вектор:
  Layer taxonomy: system | ui | domain | research | memory | plans.
  Feature taxonomy under layer: runtime, storage, dashboard, onebase, pvrg, memory, plans/work.
  Folder layout pilot:
    intent/system/runtime/work — runtime, worker, verification, phases without storage keyword
    intent/system/storage/work — storage, serialization, GBC, intent tree/hierarchy, migration
    intent/ui/dashboard/work — dashboard, board, architecture UI, atom inspector
    intent/domains/onebase/work — OneBase domain tasks
    intent/research/pvrg/work — PVRG, RAG, trace linkage research
    intent/memory/work — memory/evidence design tasks
    intent/plans/work — roadmap/phase epics (phase-* ids, roadmap atoms)
  src/intentHierarchy.mjs classifies WorkItems and builds intent.hierarchy.snapshot.v1 without mutating atom bodies.
  Reversible migration: work/backlog.bvc остаётся compatibility projection; intent/index.bvc — manifest work.id -> path.
Цель:
  Step canon migration получает machine-readable hierarchy для sidebar, architecture map и catalog alignment.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: intent-hierarchy-pilot
  work.source: design-intent-hierarchy-pilot
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Charter_And_Canon_Gates<[
Базис:
  Phase 3 связывает Step/HasC canon с Work Graph через charter gates и formatter/parser contracts.
Вектор:
  Charter gate: charter/main.bvc — project principles; plan atoms require charter preflight before backlog promotion; promote-ready calls evaluateCharterPreflightForPromote (src/charterPreflightPromoteGate.mjs).
  Step Atom gate: schemas/step-atom-draft.v1.json + src/stepAtomFormatter.mjs + protocols/step-parser-roundtrip.bvc — canonical atom shape.
  WorkItem gate: define-workitem-v1 + work/backlog.bvc/intent files — operational queue with evidence policy.
  Intent gate: intent/index.bvc manifest must list every work.id; npm run intent:migrate preserves snapshot equivalence.
  Catalog gate (derived): catalog-index maps stepTitle/guid to work.id via align-catalog-passport-with-intent-graph rules.
Цель:
  Новые atoms и tasks проходят через documented gates, а не через ad-hoc markdown.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: step-canon-charter-gates-v1
  protocol.id: intent-hierarchy-pilot
  trace.status: verified
]>

